      "_doc": "The life sketch: one sentence per fact, in this order, when the fact holds. {when} is a YEARS_WORDS phrase, {schooling} a SCHOOLING_WORDS phrase, {trade} and {job} a job or trade key with underscores read as spaces, {span} a SPAN_WORDS phrase, {office} an OFFICE_WORDS phrase. The facts come from Phase 019's implied history (the founding cast's history record) and the held kin terms. Nothing here names a world fact the resident does not hold.",
